Cutover plan for Rotterdam is final. Legacy WM is frozen on Friday 2 Oct at 1=
8:00, physical count runs Saturday 3 Oct, and EWM go-live is Tuesday 6 Oct at=
 06:00 with the first shift. Hypercare runs until 30 Oct, with a daily 15-min=
ute stand-up at 08:30 in the Rotterdam control room.

For open warehouse tasks please use /SCWM/MON, not the old LT23 lists. Lukas,=
 I need the supervisor and picker roles loaded by 30 Sep. Ruud, please confir=
m that the Rotterdam shift leaders can attend the stand-up. The plan is attac=
hed.

Best regards,
Hanna Schmidt
